        "original_id": "cae1e270-3ce6-5b0c-a710-0e676b9d1d62",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: The Arts Fuse, Visionaire\n- Places: Greater Boston, Connecticut, Maine, Massachusetts, New Hampshire, Rhode Island, Vermont, New York, New England\n- Topics: arts media, cultural events, transmedia publishing\n\nFacts:\n- The Arts Fuse is an online arts magazine that covers cultural events in Greater Boston.\n- The Arts Fuse also covers cultural events in Connecticut, Maine, Massachusetts, New Hampshire, Rhode Island, Vermont, and New York.\n- The Arts Fuse provides a next-generation platform for arts and culture consumers across New England and beyond.\n- Visionaire is a transmedia company.\n- Visionaire publishes a magazine named \"Visionaire.\"\n- Visionaire concepts, curates, and produces art multiples, events, public art installations, film, branded content, apparel, and publications.",
